| `changelog.headings.release_pattern` | string | `\[([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)\] — [0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}`; required, no default | full depth-two dated-release heading pattern | `scripts/check_structure.py` and `scripts/assemble_fragments.py` via `scripts/config_loader.py` | Exactly one capture supplies the version to the assembler replay refusal. The pattern checks shape, not calendar validity. | changelog headings: `changelog.headings` | always |
